    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to introduce No. 6 Belgrave Court, a bright and spacious one-bedroom ground floor apartment enjoying an excellent position adjacent to Belgrave Square.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent turnkey condition, this modernised apartment offers a wonderfully convenient lifestyle in a prime Dublin 6 location. Well-proportioned throughout and filled with natural light, it is an ideal choice for anyone looking for a comfortable, low-maintenance home with genuine lock-up-and-go appeal.\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular advantage. Set beside Belgrave Square, the apartment is equidistant from Rathmines and Ranelagh villages, both within easy walking distance and offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and everyday amenities. The Luas is also within approximately a five-minute walk, providing quick and convenient access to St Stephen’s Green and the city centre.\r\n\r\nThe combination of a peaceful residential setting, excellent transport links and the exceptional convenience of two established villages on the doorstep makes this a particularly attractive city home.\r\n\r\nWhether as a first home, city base, downsizer property or investment, No. 6 offers the ease of turnkey living in one of South Dublin’s most established neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nA bright, beautifully presented home combining comfort, convenience and an exceptional Dublin 6 location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Beautiful one bedroom, ground floor apartment\r\nOne allocated parking space\r\nSecure on-site bicycle parking\r\nNew electric heating system\r\nDouble glazed throughout\r\nWindows and external door replaced approx. 4 yrs ago\r\nKitchen and bathroom renovated approx. four yrs ago\r\nIntercom and alarm\r\nCommunal barbecue and patio area.\r\nManagement fee: approx. €1,100 per annum\r\nBin charges included in the annual management fee."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C1\r\nBER number: 114676620"
      }
